        "id": "textbook-buffer-intro",
        "moduleId": "buffer-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "缓冲区管理概述",
        "markdown": "缓冲区是DBMS在内存中开辟的一片区域，用于缓存从磁盘读取的数据页。由于磁盘I/O速度远低于内存访问，合理的缓冲区管理能显著减少物理I/O次数，从而提高数据库系统的整体性能。教材指出，缓冲区管理的核心任务是决定哪些数据页保留在内存中，以及当缓冲区满时选择哪个页面被淘汰。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000713"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库管理系统",
                "缓冲区管理"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11613,
              "lineEnd": 11632,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0004/images/56ced88425eb4554b28fc05f9edc93a35e93e9344fef0fb4393462d1828afdbb.jpg",
                "parts/part-0004/images/5f2fe211658465018230171583e07efec3fe77e87bc10175af61f70adee41dff.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "a8c4591e73d6a40a1be55a143e3c3ef664ade3c35bbbc93f755b68840f1d9193"
            }
          ]
